---
/**
 * Overview of the agent-credential setup, in the home-page diagram style (see FlowDemo and
 * .claude/skills/site-diagrams/SKILL.md): the issuer and the verifier above, the agent's wallet in the
 * middle holding the credential, the agent below it, and Ada beside the agent.
 */
---

<figure class="map">
  <div class="map__grid" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="node node--issuer">
      <span class="node__role">Issuer</span>
      <span class="node__name">Agent Registry</span>
    </div>
    <div class="node node--verifier">
      <span class="node__role">Verifier</span>
      <span class="node__name">Lantern Tickets</span>
    </div>

    <div class="vflow vflow--down vflow--issue">
      <span class="vflow__line"></span>
      <span class="pill"><span class="verb">issues </span><b>OpenID4VCI</b></span>
    </div>
    <div class="vflow vflow--up vflow--present">
      <span class="vflow__line"></span>
      <span class="pill"><span class="verb">presents </span><b>OpenID4VP</b></span>
    </div>

    <div class="wallet">
      <span class="node__role wallet__role">Agent's wallet</span>
      <span class="chip">Agent credential<span class="chip__by">Agent Registry</span></span>
      <span class="wallet__note">keys never leave</span>
    </div>

    <div class="spacer"></div>
    <div class="vflow vflow--both">
      <span class="vflow__line"></span>
      <span class="pill pill--ink">A2WP<span class="verb"> · MCP</span></span>
    </div>

    <div class="node node--person">
      <span class="node__role">Person</span>
      <span class="node__name">Ada</span>
    </div>
    <div class="node node--agent">
      <span class="hflow"><span class="hflow__line"></span><span class="pill">chat</span></span>
      <span class="node__role">Personal agent</span>
      <span class="node__name">OpenClaw</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="visually-hidden">
    Agent Registry issues an agent credential to the agent's wallet over OpenID4VCI. The wallet presents it to Lantern
    Tickets over OpenID4VP. The agent talks to its wallet over A2WP, as an MCP server, and Ada talks to her agent in chat.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .map {
    margin: 28px 0 32px;
    padding: 24px 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  .map__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    column-gap: 56px;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .node {
    position: relative;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-top: 3px solid var(--hue, var(--line));
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .node--issuer {
    --hue: var(--violet);
  }
  .node--verifier {
    --hue: var(--cobalt);
  }
  .node--agent {
    --hue: var(--ink);
  }
  .node__role {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .node__name {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 2px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .vflow {
    position: relative;
    height: 64px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .vflow__line {
    position: absolute;
    top: 6px;
    bottom: 6px;
    left: 50%;
    border-left: 1.5px solid var(--hue, #c8c8d0);
  }
  .vflow--issue {
    --hue: var(--violet);
  }
  .vflow--present {
    --hue: var(--cobalt);
  }
  .vflow--both {
    --hue: var(--ink);
  }
  .vflow--down .vflow__line::after,
  .vflow--both .vflow__line::after,
  .vflow--up .vflow__line::before,
  .vflow--both .vflow__line::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: -5.75px;
    border: 5px solid transparent;
  }
  .vflow--down .vflow__line::after,
  .vflow--both .vflow__line::after {
    bottom: -1px;
    border-top: 7px solid var(--hue);
    border-bottom-width: 0;
  }
  .vflow--up .vflow__line::before,
  .vflow--both .vflow__line::before {
    top: -1px;
    border-bottom: 7px solid var(--hue);
    border-top-width: 0;
  }

  .pill {
    position: relative;
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: #fff;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .pill b {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .pill--ink {
    background: var(--ink);
    border-color: var(--ink);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .wallet {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 10px 16px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: #111114;
  }
  .wallet__role {
    color: #c8c8d0;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    height: 38px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--violet);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .chip__by {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 400;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  .wallet__note {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #8b8b94;
  }

  /* Ada ⇄ agent, drawn across the column gap. */
  .hflow {
    position: absolute;
    right: 100%;
    top: 50%;
    width: 56px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .hflow__line {
    position: absolute;
    left: 4px;
    right: 4px;
    top: 0;
    border-top: 1.5px solid #c8c8d0;
  }
  .hflow .pill {
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    font-size: 10px;
    padding: 2px 7px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .map {
      padding: 18px 12px;
    }
    .map__grid {
      column-gap: 40px;
    }
    .hflow {
      width: 40px;
    }
    .pill {
      font-size: 10px;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 420px) {
    .verb {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
